  <item>
    <title>放下《奥本海默》，去码头整点薯条</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/650842085c88d2412633ef94</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">650842085c88d2412633ef94</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 18 Sep 2023 12:26:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>和朋友去了一趟香港，看了IMAX版本和胶片版。做了一期奥本海默生平的前瞻，看了全片之后发现前瞻还是别发了。准备了这么多，终归还是错付了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期我们聊聊该如何欢送这部电影。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：</span><br><span>@来点几迪（B站、抖音同名）</span><br><span>灿燃</span><br><span>HANS</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 短片《耐心》向我们展示何为“宏大叙事的切口”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="446">07:26</a> ✈️ 去了趟香港</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="692">11:32</a> 为什么用这样的结构？影响诺兰的小说《水之乡》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="778">12:58</a> 诺兰没有真正选择一个切口</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1108">18:28</a> 灿燃家里曾经是开照相馆的</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1258">20:58</a> 胶片如何逼迫我们反思工作方法</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1473">24:33</a> 艺术家如何被材质定义</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1952">32:32</a> 电影工作者的作品是U盘</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2274">37:54</a> 🎇安塞姆·基弗在高古轩画廊</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2478">41:18</a> 裸戏不仅是尊严，更是魔法💫</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2930">48:50</a> 找切口：围绕爱德华·泰勒与奥本海默</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3149">52:29</a> 找切口：Kity与Jean Tatlock</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3504">58:24</a> 找切口：人类文明曾经天真过</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3954">65:54</a> 🍣政客在福岛吃海鲜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsYr-L-f5udTFh-YWzl_65dacusI.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr0_R9K9_c_nRWueM45yToe5DIlM.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiHENQWWbbZU2s4NpkOR_VIpeiaJ.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjFRFIv4fbJ5zQr35ge2Bg51scDK.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loWE503pNZKD8aoIdxOgf4B9PDAL.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkt2J_wGLZ5oYMd0OHmuFewQMwxs.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu58Zb1r1EjTappjg8Hn36sL6aZE.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs86-Qv5rnlqDtOhPan_dSHn2M1i.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi7U69vXdNo75ZNVSeUtea1-3pd7.png"></figure>]]></description>
