  <item>
    <title>每个被影视行业摧残的青年，都该去一趟FIRST</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64d97e0ae490c5dee55b09c5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64d97e0ae490c5dee55b09c5</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 14 Aug 2023 01:06:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>播主：</span><br><span>灿燃（超短片单元《她去上班了》导演 超短片评审团大奖）</span><br><span>王众（训练营“越界”短片《暑间即兴》演员）</span><br><span>HANS（短片主竞赛单元《语言的爱》演员）</span><br><span>——以上是我们哥仨的“说法儿”</span></p><p><span>时间轴：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">02:35</a> 来FIRST 玩儿的气氛！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 西宁之夜——声音玩具</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a> 被西北热情教育了一回</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 人有三急之六台水库</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="691">11:31</a> 训练营短片“越界”展映</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="945">15:45</a> i人社恐大联欢</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1255">20:55</a> 《银河写手》与饱受摧残的编剧生涯</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1390">23:10</a> 横评某些其它糟心电影节</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1718">28:38</a> i人酒会</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1852">30:52</a> 有些想吐槽的地方</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2013">33:33</a> 《暑间即兴》“混蛋”在哪儿？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2200">36:40</a> 陈哲艺 与 童瑶</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2413">40:13</a> 远在湟中</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2572">42:52</a> 王众的生命财产安全受到了威胁</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3131">52:11</a> 《语言的爱》令王众emo</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3489">58:09</a> 《她去上班了》得奖记</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4028">67:08</a> 江疏影能拿着一千块吗？</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlVS6d60JTewpJS0na0DbxyS-4er.JPG"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq_4Amyfg5lfG_WrF04GMjGIAhZ-.JPG"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoQOZmOkNxxxYmZQj3ehOBoruUAr.JPG"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgp6QxbXVJ6aH-quM97oqOtM4zcf.JPG"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkz4-oM7UcktLBh5QQkvKImb7sJe.png"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkxmx_rKhGYQVQZDHwlrLibr6TbQ.png"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljCrvqsBK205LTX78ITD9i2Vfd4M.png"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lp_pnO454T7mmUQHkN60d_5gs8yf.png"></figure><p><br></p><p></p>]]></description>
