  <item>
    <title>寻找沈默——《漫长的季节》后记</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/647c8b4f1672628240d9d2cc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">647c8b4f1672628240d9d2cc</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 04 Jun 2023 13:02:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>{一人谈}</span><br><span>《漫长的季节》热度逐渐褪去，给我留下一个关于沈默的疑问。我阅读了最近上架的原著小说《凛冬之刃》，对比了两个截然不同的沈默。试图从原著于小千和辛爽导演组两种诠释中还原创作者面临的具体情境，以及引发的问题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>涉及作品：</span><br><span>《凛冬之刃》</span><br><span>《漫长的季节》</span><br><span>《此房是我造》</span><br><span>《踏血寻梅》</span><br><span>《白夜行》</span><br><span>《幻夜》</span><br><span>《嫌疑人X的献身》</span></p><span></span><p><span>特别鸣谢：</span><br><span>Sasha 老大 小吉</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间线：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="12">00:12</a> 引子——海哥事件引发的疑问</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="222">03:42</a> 为什么要回望《凛冬之刃》？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">08:40</a> 沈默与傅卫军的关系</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> 沈辉事件——水曲柳叶</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> 一盒锅包肉点燃的诱惑</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="905">15:05</a> 三人行？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1144">19:04</a> 卢文仲绑架案</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1448">24:08</a> 殷红入套</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1719">28:39</a> 桦运专线的梦魇</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1833">30:33</a> 王阳之死</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1916">31:56</a> 奇情之巅</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2145">35:45</a> 王响的原罪</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2365">39:25</a> 被阉割的沈默</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2822">47:02</a> 沈默，是连环杀手</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3110">51:50</a> 沈默这一生到底想要什么</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3270">54:30</a> 《白夜行》的邪恶主动性</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3489">58:09</a> 可爱的“丢戏”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3608">60:08</a> 《幻夜》的控制关系</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">64:00</a> 《白夜行》日剧的“夕子事件”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4170">69:30</a> 总结：何为啃节儿？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljFaPz6Iyc8xQyDLETtTS5AzyFgd.m4a" length="140547807" type="audio/mp4"/>
