    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>还演吗？还接着演吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/646c96a21672628240d818af</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">646c96a21672628240d818af</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 23 May 2023 10:34:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>{三人谈}</span></p><p><span>本期播主：老马 小马 HANS</span></p><p><span>这是一次短片创作的复盘，针对老马的作品《语言的爱》。</span></p><p><span>咱们真得好好谈谈表演。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="99">01:39</a> 《语言的爱》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="232">03:52</a> 洪尚秀的方法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="548">09:08</a> 我们是怎么走到这一步的？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="709">11:49</a> 侯导短片作品《清白》的缘分</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="887">14:47</a> 谁被当做了工具</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1051">17:31</a> 学导演时落下的“坏毛病”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1224">20:24</a> 关于表演时的对手</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1354">22:34</a> 假模假式的“过事儿”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1485">24:45</a> 给你带来改观的表演作品/经历</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1765">29:25</a> 夸夸陈宣宇和《清白》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">31:50</a> 抖音表演作为艺术</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2082">34:42</a> 最烦半真不假的现实主义</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2230">37:10</a> 别逼我摇头</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2322">38:42</a> 侯宝林 刘宝瑞 薛宝钗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2470">41:10</a> 全家人都陪着我演</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2840">47:20</a> 积木表演让我安心</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> “你不拍全班都别拍！”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3243">54:03</a> “你以后说话过过脑子吧。”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3494">58:14</a> 我不能让每个角色都扮演我自己</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a> “你看外边有条龙”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3760">62:40</a> 《狂飙》中的张颂文与周遭配角</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3848">64:08</a> 守住底线就是我的工作</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4032">67:12</a> 要比“185体育生”再多一点点</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4141">69:01</a> 一个导演与一对演员的三角形</span></p><p><span>其中提到的：</span></p><p><span>《玉熙的电影》</span></p><p><span>《草叶集》</span></p><p><span>《江原道之力》</span></p><p><span>《猪堕井的一天》</span></p><p><span>Sanford Meisner</span></p><p><span>《长大》</span></p><p><span>陈宣宇</span></p><p><span>带篮子/药水哥/李干/孙笑川</span></p><p><span>澡堂大厅/延边杀手</span></p><p><span>OST:</span><br><span><old melody="">-Beverly Glenn-Copeland</old></span></p><p><span>&lt;静止&gt;-花儿乐队</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkxZERxb081NQ3SAGTGtvxndydcS.m4a" length="143813028" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:14:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z1TWNrdlFEUFlfZF9tSjhzZFF6WnhPMXMzY3QucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
